cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, using a specific release tag."

title: "Un Coup de Dés: a layered, machine-readable encoding"
abstract: >-
  A citable minimal encoding of the printed layout of Stéphane
  Mallarmé's Un Coup de Dés jamais n'abolira le Hasard, as set in the
  Ronat–Papp edition of 1980. The base layer (level-0) records a
  deliberately limited set of observable typographic features and
  excludes syntax, layout coordinates, variants, and interpretation,
  so that later layers can be added by reference without altering it.

type: dataset

authors:
